# Touch rotation for portrait mode - DEPRECATED
#
# libinput quirks file format (MatchUdevType) doesn't work on libinput 1.28.
# Touch rotation is now handled via:
#   1. udev rule: /etc/udev/rules.d/99-touch-rotate.rules
#   2. hwdb entry: /etc/udev/hwdb.d/99-touch-rotate.hwdb
#   3. Lightdm session-setup-script: /usr/bin/delta-touch-setup
#
# CRITICAL: labwc rc.xml must NOT contain a <touch> element - it interferes
# with the udev calibration matrix. The calibration is applied at the
# libinput level before labwc opens the device.
#
# See install-services.sh for deployment.
